{
  "name": "visits-prune",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Drop website visits after 90 days\n\nDrops `visits` rows older than **90 days**, every night at 03:00.\n\n### How it works\n**This is not housekeeping.** The website's privacy policy states a 90-day retention window, and raw IP addresses are personal data. Without this workflow that published claim is false.\n\n**Drop Old Visits** hands the records store a time. The store counts a row's age from when it was kept and decides how rows leave. A failure reaches the error workflow, so a night without pruning does not pass unseen.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Import a records store (`19_records-store`) and select it in **Drop Old Visits**. It must be the same store **Keep Visit** in `visit-log` writes to.\n2. Change the 90 in the node's `before` expression if your policy states another window.\n3. Activate.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "a5b6c7d8-0001-4001-8001-000000000001",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 3
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a5b6c7d8-0002-4002-8002-000000000002",
      "name": "Daily at 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_RECORDS_STORE_WORKFLOW_ID",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultUrl": "/workflow/YOUR_RECORDS_STORE_WORKFLOW_ID",
          "cachedResultName": "Records Store (Google Sheets)"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
